      "page": 1,
      "text": "HT-8\nEightballers\nCDR D. Burkett NAS WHITING FIELD, FL CDR S. Kohl\nCommanding Officer Executive Officer\nTraining the World's Best Helicopter Pilots\nSunday, 08-Nov-2026\nSUNRISE: 06:09 MOONRISE: 05:34 % ILLUM: 1% JULIAN DATE: 6312\nSUNSET: 16:55 MOONSET: 16:18\nTOTAL FLY EVENTS: 6 TOTAL FLY HRS: 12.0\nTOTAL SIM EVENTS: 0 TOTAL SIM HRS: 0.0\nQuestions:\nEP Question: BATTERY TEMPERATURE HIGH\nGeneral: T/F: Prepo aircraft shall perform a battery start prior to leaving NDZ.\nNATOPS: What is the difference between EEC, MEC and MAN modes of operations?\nSOP: Simulated emergencies on course rules are prohibited when the ceiling is below ____ feet AGL.\nDUTY/WATCH ASSIGNED SIGN IN SIGN OUT\nFDO LT HUNG C 0700 0659\nDUTY DRIVER ENS RIEBE J 0730 0729\nAM SDO 1stLt MICO D 0700 1900\nPM SDO LTJG GRIFFEY I 1900 0700\n***** Notes *****\nSouth Field CTO 0700-1600\nRECOVERY\n***** Upcoming Events *****\nWINDOW\n1700-2100\nVETERAN\u2019S DAY \u2013 11 NOV\nPace CLOSED\nSAU CHANGE OF COMMAND \u2013 12 NOV\nSpencer CLOSED\nSanta Rosa CLOSED\nHarold CLOSED\nSite X CLOSED\nChoctaw CLOSED\nSTANDING NOTES:\n1. Snivels shall be in T-SHARP NLT 0800, two working days prior to the date of the snivel. Late snivels require a T-SHARP\nentry followed by verbal notification to the Operations Duty Officer. Late snivels will be handled on a case-by-case basis.\n2. All CAIs and MIL Classes are accessed via T-SHARP: https://tsharp.navsea.cloud.navy.mil . Students are responsible for\nensuring all prerequisite CAIs are completed prior to scheduled events.\n3. All are highly encouraged to complete SAFREP if a notable event occurs: https://saferep.safety.af.mil/\n4. Access publications via Eightball University: https://www.cnatra.navy.mil/tw5/ht8/university.asp or the HT-8 Sharepoint:\nhttps://flankspeed.sharepoint-mil.us/sites/HT-8Main/SitePages/HT8Home.aspx"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "SAFETY OFFICER OPERATIONS OFFICER EXECUTIVE OFFICER COMMANDING OFFICER\nD. MirandaHidalgo, Maj, USMC M. Dominik, LCDR, USNR S. Kohl, CDR, USN D. Burkett, CDR, USN\nFlight (Flight Event) Schedule\nLINE BRIEF SCHD SCHD LNCH LAND INSTRUCTOR STUDENT TYPE SCHD REMARKS\nNUM TIME T/O LAND ICAO ICAO EVENT FLT\nTIME\nT02-1 1000 1215 1815 KSGJ KNDZ Maj LIBERT N 1stLt CABAN M NAV4002A, 6.0 CCX RTB FROM ST\n1stLt GOSSELIN C NAV4101A AUGUSTINE, FL\nRI4203A\nT06-1 1000 1215 1815 KSGJ KNDZ LT HYNDS S LTJG RAUCCI Z RI4202A, 6.0 CCX RTB FROM ST\nLTJG GRUENDLING K RI4203A AUGUSTINE, FL\nRI4203A\nSimulator (Sim Event) Schedule\nLINE BRIEF SCHD SIM/ INSTRUCTOR STUDENT TYPE SCHD REMARKS\nDEVICE\nNUM TIME T/O EVENT TIME\nNo Simulators Scheduled\nGround Events\nTime Event Location Person Instructor Remarks\nNo Ground Events Scheduled"
